version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-16"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mettalrose/genai_policy_tracker_rcws_tpc"
url: "https://mettalrose.github.io/genai_policy_tracker_rcws_tpc/"
abstract: >-
  Links to the generative AI policies that govern journals in rhetoric, composition and
  writing studies (RCWS) and technical and professional communication (TPC), including journal-specific policies,
  publisher-wide policies, and guidance from organizations such as COPE and ICMJE.
  Working prototype; only journals with a located policy are included.
keywords:
  - generative AI
  - publication ethics
  - rhetoric
  - writing studies
  - technical and professional communication
  - journal policies
